OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty former Debenhams store
OL,4,Abought by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Debenhams store in Ipswich
OL,7,Fhas been bought by the borough council
OL,8,Ffor an undisclosed amount.
OL,10,FIt was originally sold in April 2021 to
OL,11,Fthe Unex Group, a Newmarket-based
OL,12,Fproperty investment firm, for more than
OL,13,F#3m, but has been vacant ever since.
OL,15,FThe retail space is a large and
OL,16,Fprominent one, on the town's Cornhill.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
