OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty former Debenhams store
OL,4,Abought by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeil McDonald, leader at the Labour-run
OL,7,Fcouncil, said: "By bringing the site
OL,8,Finto council ownership, we can remove a
OL,9,Flong-standing blight, unlock future
OL,10,Fredevelopment and create an opportunity
OL,11,Ffor something much better for Ipswich."
